text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Wee Dragonauts gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Ripple 4 (When you cast this spell, you may reveal the top four cards of your library. You may cast spells with the same name as this spell from among those cards without paying their mana costs. Put the rest on the bottom of your library.)\\nSurging Flame deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it and exile that card.', "When Coiling Oracle enters the battlefield, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand."]
flavor: ['"The blazekite is a simple concept, really—just a vehicular application of dragscoop ionics and electropropulsion magnetronics."\\n—Juzba, Izzet tinker', '"We have no need for military might. We wield two of the sharpest swords ever forged: Faith in our left hand, Wealth in our right."\\n—Vuliev of the Ghost Council', 'Snaking remnants of nature directed by a body of thought and progress, the oracles embody all that is Simic.']
